# Explicit shape selection through the shared editor and Rehearsal board.
# Receipt geometry: requested 1100x900, actual 1100x752 logical, DPI 2, zoom 1.
# Shape buttons use measured painted positions because the probe's independent
# selector layout misses these controls. Production-host selector/input tests
# cover the resize-independent behavior in layout_tests.rs.
settle 3
act stage-context-example
settle 3
click .pill Rehearsal
settle 3
assert snap section == Rehearsal
assert snap shape-index == none
capture 01_all_tones
pointer-click 304 320
settle 3
assert snap shape-index == 0
assert snap shape-dots <= 6
assert text bounded selection
capture 02_first_shape
pointer-click 608 320
settle 3
assert snap shape-index == 1
capture 03_second_shape
pointer-click 77 320
settle 3
assert snap shape-index == 0
pointer-click 220 127
settle 3
pointer-click 704 320
settle 3
assert snap shape-index == none
assert snap shape-dots >= 12
capture 04_restored_map
